every tick:
    set {_p} to player("Kundaliel")
    set {_e} to {_p}'s eye
    set {_e} to location 0.25 meters in front of {_e}
    add location 0.1 meters to the left of {_e} to {_e::*}
    add location 0.1 meters to the right of {_e} to {_e::*}
    loop all players:
        loop-player's world is {_p}'s world
        make 1 of electric spark at {_e::*} with extra 0 for {_p}